  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織……結果、聞いたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001040010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい\r\n……まだ、レッスンが足りなかったようですね",
    "charAnim1": "yes",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200104/7002001040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、その……\r\n灯織は十分に頑張って……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001040020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "大丈夫です、そんな言葉は必要ありません",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200104/7002001040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001040030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……今は慰めよりも、\r\n優先すべきことがあります",
    "charAnim1": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200104/7002001040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001040040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私に何が足りなかったのかを考え、\r\n今後のレッスンに反映すべきです",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200104/7002001040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……そうか、灯織はまだ諦めていないんだ\r\n俺もその気持ちに応えないと……！）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだよな\r\nさっそく、作戦会議しないとな！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
